    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328-a2">

                <pb facs="0830" n="708" xml:id="pg708"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    156.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Sublime Porte to Mr.
                            Straus.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-12-25"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 25,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In reply to the <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi> the legation of the
                    United States kindly addressed on the 18th October last, the ministry of foreign
                    affairs has the honor to transmit herewith copy of a report of the
                    administrative council of civil medical affairs concerning the diplomas of
                    physicians granted by the college of the Bellevue Hospital at New York.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
